Q71. How would you implement agent observability?
Answer: Use Arize Phoenix or Langfuse to capture model calls, agent delegation, retrieval results, tool decisions and evaluation metrics with sensitive-data controls.
Q72. How would you implement tenant-aware audit logging?
Answer: Generate structured, append-only audit events containing tenant ID, actor identity, action, policy version, decision and correlation ID.
Q73. How would you implement evaluation gates?
Answer: Integrate golden-dataset evaluations, security tests, accuracy thresholds and cost-latency regression checks into CI/CD pipelines.
Q74. How would you implement dedicated tenant execution pools?
Answer: Provision tenant-specific worker pools, queues, inference endpoints, IAM identities and data stores through Terraform.
